# Lane A files

Follow `.agents/skills/lane-a-shell/SKILL.md` and `reference.md`.

- `wikiApi` is the only module that talks to wikipedia.org. `action=parse&prop=text`. Check `res.ok`. Normalize lookup keys with underscores.
- Clock is `performance.now() - t0`. `rAF` paints; it does not measure. Stamp the player at click.
- `Winner` is `"bot" | "human" | "none"`. No tie path. Photo-finish caption if margin < 1.0s.
- `mockFeed` hops must be legal §5.3 moves. `anchor_text` is required.
- Do not edit `theme.css` tokens or `agent/types.ts`.
- Nav pill is grey. One black CTA at a time. Grey pills sit on `--card-green`, never on beige.
